                                                "sense_id": "7d8f9063-e20c-333e-bc7f-e919f3d67623",
                                                "text": "\"US fund manager Eric Knight has a fearful reputation as a shareholder activist, geeing up underperforming managements at Royal Dutch Shell and Suez.\" – HSBC: activist pounces, The Week, 15 September 2007, 631, 43."
